1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,020
For years, every answer was the same

2
00:00:04,020 --> 00:00:07,700
"It's probably nothing," so I hid the pain

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,900
I started thinking I was crazy

4
00:00:11,460 --> 00:00:14,820
That it was all inside my head

5
00:00:15,060 --> 00:00:18,980
Till the scans came back with answers

6
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:22,100
"Stage four" is what they said

7
00:00:22,100 --> 00:00:26,260
I was almost relieved, I told them then

8
00:00:26,260 --> 00:00:29,620
"At least now we know where to begin"

9
00:00:29,620 --> 00:00:33,060
No more hearing "Nothing's wrong with you"

10
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:36,980
Now we've got a fight and a way through
